{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-27 16:40:00', 'title': 'LUV INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , JAN. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R. CRUZ ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST AIRLINES" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV).'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-27 05:45:00', 'title': 'LUV SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS SOUTHWEST SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 13, 2023', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (NYSE: LUV). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/SOUTHWEST-AIRLINES-CO-LAWSUIT-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=35973&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SOUTHWEST BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND\xa0DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}